OL,3,GNEWSAJudge's trial of the facts review
OL,4,Awill assess if victims are 'sidelined'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former senior judge who is carrying
OL,7,Fout a review of the legal framework on
OL,8,Ftrial of the facts cases in Northern
OL,9,FIreland has said he wants to look into
OL,10,Fwhether victims are "being sidelined".
OL,12,FSir John Gillen, who led a major review
OL,13,Fof sexual offence trials in 2019, is
OL,14,Fexpected to deliver an interim report
OL,15,Fby February 2027.
OL,17,FIt comes after Eleanor Donaldson, wife
OL,18,Fof convicted sex offender Jeffrey
OL,19,FDonaldson, faced a trial of the facts
OL,20,Fafter being found unfit for a
OL,21,Fconventional trial on mental health
OL,22,Fgrounds.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
