OL,3,GNEWSAJudge's trial of the facts review
OL,4,Awill assess if victims are 'sidelined'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSir John said he will also explore what
OL,7,Fhappens in a case when a defendant
OL,8,Flater "becomes fit" after being deemed
OL,9,Funfit to stand trial.
